{"voice":"kokoro af_heart","speed":0.92,"pages":{"0":{"title":"Chike and His Flying Box","text":"","src":"p0.mp3","dur":2.5,"t":[]},"1":{"text":"“This could be a spaceship,” Chike said. The empty box was almost as tall as he was, and he could already picture it zooming into the sky.","src":"p1.mp3","dur":8.97,"t":[[0.08,0.52],[0.52,0.68],[0.68,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,1.34],[1.9,2.26],[2.26,2.66],[3.12,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,3.86],[3.86,4.12],[4.12,4.46],[4.46,4.7],[4.7,4.94],[4.94,5.16],[5.16,5.26],[5.26,5.5],[5.88,6.08],[6.08,6.18],[6.18,6.32],[6.32,6.56],[6.56,6.92],[6.92,7.2],[7.2,7.56],[7.56,7.8],[7.8,7.92],[7.92,8.2]]},"2":{"text":"He found the box beside the recycling bin. Mateo looked at the sunny backyard. “Or a flying machine,” he said. They taped on wings and named it The Sky Spark.","src":"p2.mp3","dur":11.28,"t":[[0,0.36],[0.36,0.54],[0.54,0.68],[0.68,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.58],[1.58,1.92],[1.92,2.36],[2.94,3.52],[3.52,3.72],[3.72,3.92],[3.92,4],[4,4.22],[4.22,4.82],[5.36,5.6],[5.6,5.74],[5.74,5.98],[5.98,6.46],[6.46,7.12],[7.12,7.4],[7.94,8.06],[8.06,8.3],[8.3,8.54],[8.54,8.76],[8.76,9.24],[9.24,9.48],[9.48,9.66],[9.66,9.8],[9.8,10.04],[10.04,10.44]]},"3":{"text":"Chike climbed in and pushed off with his feet. The box tipped gently into the grass. The wings folded.","src":"p3.mp3","dur":6.9,"t":[[0.32,0.68],[0.68,0.86],[0.86,1.24],[1.24,1.44],[1.44,1.64],[1.64,1.9],[1.9,2.04],[2.04,2.16],[2.16,2.38],[3.02,3.07],[3.04,3.22],[3.22,3.6],[3.6,4.02],[4.02,4.36],[4.36,4.46],[4.46,4.76],[5.4,5.48],[5.48,5.66],[5.66,6.22]]},"4":{"text":"“Our first test taught us something,” Mateo said, holding up a bent wing. “The wings need more support.” Chike nodded. “Then let’s make them stronger.”","src":"p4.mp3","dur":10.4,"t":[[0.22,0.44],[0.44,0.68],[0.68,0.96],[0.96,1.34],[1.34,1.48],[1.48,1.84],[2.3,2.72],[2.72,3.02],[3.34,3.54],[3.54,3.78],[3.78,3.86],[3.86,4.08],[4.08,4.36],[5.1,5.18],[5.18,5.38],[5.38,5.78],[5.78,6],[6,6.52],[7.16,7.32],[7.32,7.74],[8.4,8.58],[8.58,8.94],[8.94,9.08],[9.08,9.24],[9.24,9.6]]},"5":{"text":"They built a wider base, added cardboard braces, and tested every piece. The Sky Spark did not truly fly, but it rolled beautifully down the hill.","src":"p5.mp3","dur":10.55,"t":[[0,0.36],[0.36,0.54],[0.54,0.74],[0.74,0.96],[0.96,1.34],[1.82,2.1],[2.1,2.38],[2.38,3.02],[3.46,3.64],[3.64,3.9],[3.9,4.3],[4.3,4.72],[5.56,5.64],[5.64,5.88],[5.88,6.22],[6.22,6.58],[6.58,6.84],[6.84,7.2],[7.2,7.66],[8.16,8.32],[8.32,8.42],[8.42,8.62],[8.62,9.14],[9.14,9.56],[9.56,9.68],[9.68,9.9]]},"7":{"text":"What Chike and Mateo learned “We did not make a flying box,” Chike said. “We made a better idea.”","src":"p7.mp3","dur":7.5,"t":[[0.2,0.46],[0.46,1],[1,1.18],[1.18,1.68],[1.68,1.9],[2.6,2.82],[2.82,2.96],[2.96,3.1],[3.1,3.32],[3.32,3.44],[3.44,3.7],[3.7,4.16],[4.58,4.88],[4.88,5.26],[5.68,5.84],[5.84,6.02],[6.02,6.12],[6.12,6.32],[6.32,6.92]]},"8":{"text":"3 big takeaways Word to know brace A brace is an extra piece added to hold something up and make it stronger. Every Test Teaches Something When Chike pushed off in the Sky Spark, the box tipped into the grass and the wings folded. Instead of giving up, Mateo said their first test taught them something: the wings needed more support. Make It Wider and Stronger Chike and Mateo built a wider base, added cardboard braces and tested every piece. The Sky Spark did not truly fly, but it rolled beautifully down the hill, and they made a better idea. Try it at home: Stand a paper towel tube on its end and gently tap it, then tape it to a wide piece of cardboard and tap again to see which one tips over less.","src":"p8.mp3","dur":49.11,"t":[[0,0.24],[0.48,0.76],[0.76,1.3],[1.86,2.12],[2.12,2.3],[2.3,2.5],[3.02,3.36],[4.08,4.14],[4.14,4.34],[4.34,4.68],[4.68,4.8],[4.8,5.1],[5.1,5.46],[5.46,5.8],[5.8,6.02],[6.02,6.24],[6.24,6.6],[6.6,6.9],[6.9,7.1],[7.1,7.26],[7.26,7.4],[7.4,7.7],[8.52,8.58],[8.58,8.96],[8.96,9.32],[9.32,9.78],[10.5,10.68],[10.68,11.14],[11.14,11.42],[11.42,11.64],[11.64,11.7